@startuml profile-model
title Profile 视图模型 (/profile)
' Delta 链（文档）：model → component；为可预览，不内容 include 异构图
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class ProfilePageViewModel {
  mode: string
}

class ProfileFormVM {
}

class EducationPeriodVM {
  educationPeriodId: UUID
  institutionName: string
}

class WorkAuthorizationVM {
  workAuthorizationId: UUID
  permissionType: string
}

class TargetRoleVM {
  targetRoleId: UUID
  roleName: string
}

class LanguageProficiencyVM {
  languageProficiencyId: UUID
  languageCode: string
  proficiency: string
}

class RecomputeRequestVM {
  scopes: string[]
  status: string
}

class BackupStatusVM {
  retentionCount: int
  scheduleCron: string
}

ProfilePageViewModel --> ProfileFormVM
ProfileFormVM *-- EducationPeriodVM
ProfileFormVM *-- WorkAuthorizationVM
ProfileFormVM *-- TargetRoleVM
ProfileFormVM *-- LanguageProficiencyVM
ProfilePageViewModel --> RecomputeRequestVM
ProfilePageViewModel --> BackupStatusVM

note bottom of BackupStatusVM
  retentionCount = 4
  scheduleCron = Sun 03:00
end note

note bottom of RecomputeRequestVM
  scopes: ROADMAP / JOB_GATE / JOB_RANK
  status: PENDING / DEFERRED / ...
end note

@enduml
